                "text": "This is a normal build for the dependabot\\/pip\\/sqlalchemy-1.3.4 branch. You should be able to reproduce it by checking out the branch locally.\n\n## Jobs and Stages\nThis build has **two jobs**, running in parallel.\n\n<table>\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Job</th>\n    <th>Python</th>\n    <th>State</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a href='https://travis-ci.com/dependabot/example/jobs/203476342'><img src='https://travis-ci.com/images/stroke-icons/icon-passed.png' height='11'> 827.1</a></td>\n    <td>3.6</td>\n    <td>passed</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a href='https://travis-ci.com/dependabot/example/jobs/203476343'><img src='https://travis-ci.com/images/stroke-icons/icon-passed.png' height='11'> 827.2</a></td>\n    <td>3.7</td>\n    <td>passed</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n## Build Configuration\n\nBuild Option     | Setting\n-----------------|--------------\nLanguage         | Python\nOperating System | Linux (Xenial)\nPython Versions  | 3.6, 3.7\n\n<details>\n<summary>Build Configuration</summary>\n<pre lang='yaml'>\n{\n  \"os\": \"linux\",\n  \"dist\": \"xenial\",\n  \"cache\": \"pip\",\n  \"group\": \"stable\",\n  \"addons\": {\n    \"postgresql\": \"9.6\"\n  },\n  \"python\": [\n    \"3.6\",\n    \"3.7\"\n  ],\n  \"script\": [\n    \"matcher db upgrade\",\n    \"python setup.py flake8\",\n    \"pytest --cov=./\"\n  ],\n  \".result\": \"configured\",\n  \"install\": [\n    \"pip install codecov\",\n    \"pip install -r requirements-dev.txt\",\n    \"python setup.py develop\"\n  ],\n  \"language\": \"python\",\n  \"services\": [\n    \"postgresql\"\n  ],\n  \"global_env\": [\n    \"DATA_DIR=/tmp/matcher\"\n  ],\n  \"after_success\": [\n    \"codecov\"\n  ],\n  \"before_script\": [\n    \"psql -c 'create database matcher;' -U postgres\"\n  ]\n}\n</pre>\n</details>",
